{"id": "EUVD-2026-104921", "enisaUuid": "1641ae16-3c55-3f22-abe9-5373b9681564", "description": "react-admin before 5.15.5 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability that allows attackers to inject scripts by storing javascript: URIs in record fields rendered by UrlField and FileField. Attackers who can influence URL-type backend fields can execute JavaScript in an administrator's authenticated session when the administrator clicks the rendered link.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T10:41:36", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T13:26:16", "baseScore": 5.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:L/VI:L/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/marmelab/react-admin/issues/11408", "https://github.com/marmelab/react-admin/commit/d20820a05dc8094d322ffa3f0bd9800501acb0a8", "https://github.com/marmelab/react-admin/releases/tag/v5.15.5", "https://github.com/marmelab/react-admin/blob/3119d7e56c178e699a2247b67868a4613039ffc3/packages/ra-ui-materialui/src/field/UrlField.tsx", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/react-admin-before-5.15.5-stored-xss-via-urlfield-and-filefield"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-113350", "GHSA-j95f-gmvj-5c83"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.21, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "af954592-c664-3c02-b03f-70e487a0e4a0", "product": {"name": "react-admin", "vendor": {"name": "marmelab"}}, "product_version": "0 <5.15.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "c45b9360-64e3-39e4-a2c2-af237432a8d7", "vendor": {"name": "marmelab"}}], "isExploited": false}